Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, thus, a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come above the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.26,0:00:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\NThen we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.94,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you want it,\NThen you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise,\NAnd freedom is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.82,0:01:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.38,0:01:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it be so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, filled with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling\Nalive, but I'll be loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day, I'd make my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through,\Nit's a wave in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The world I'm feeling\Nalive, look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.82,0:02:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.94,0:02:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He isn't spewing blood everywhere,\Nso I guess he's better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:02:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to swim, too. You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is get you a bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can have one made in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.48,0:03:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound good? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a lucky break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji's blood type is\Nrare, and we're all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.73,0:03:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like seriously bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kuma? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.10,0:03:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's somebody I'd really like\Nto see if we can find them somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.54,0:03:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.90,0:03:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mermaid Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.95,0:03:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They call him Boss down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.58,0:03:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, when you say Jinbe, you're\Ntalking about the Warlord Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Or, I mean, former Warlord, since he\Nresigned after the whole war thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.16,0:03:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's a good friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.02,0:03:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Him and the Pirate Empress?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.52,0:03:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You make some weird friends\Nwhen we're not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When Ace died two years ago, I had\Na tough time pulling it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I doubt I'd even be here\Nright now if it wasn't for his help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to talk to him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.68,0:03:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,See you on Fishman Island in two years!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.44,0:04:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure to bring your entire crew along.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.98,0:04:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to meeting everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He said to meet here, and there's\Nno way I'm going to let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard he went to\NMarineford with you when you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,rang that bell and\Neveryone got all worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You know where we can find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's kind of tricky,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,because Boss doesn't exactly live\Non the island with everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Since he resigned from the warlords,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,they have to treat him\Nlike a normal pirate again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That means all the fishman pirates\Ncan't stay in the city anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so they found a new place to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.30,0:04:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's where you'll have\Nto go if you want to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This place has some dumb rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it seems weird, but even\Nthough we're all the way down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the war of the best ended\Nup affecting us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma! Kuma! Kuma! Kuma! Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.50,0:04:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a big ship coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ship from the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.80,0:04:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but maybe nobody's on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.17,0:04:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course someone is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.38,0:04:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So did you see somebody\Non the ship or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.65,0:04:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was for sure the royal family ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't usually come around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they've come here to arrest Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,because he didn't enter\Nthe city the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys had better hide\Nbefore they get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That ship's the Royal Gondola.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so. I knew.\NMaybe. Totally. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I doubt anyone from the\NRoyal Family is actually riding on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This corner of the island's\Nsort of out of the way for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,so they don't usually bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, all citizens!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The three Neptune brothers have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, ladies of the cove!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.78,0:05:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that you can\Nanswer an inquiry of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.88,0:05:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,no
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.18,0:06:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,hide
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.14,0:06:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.97,0:06:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, water?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.86,0:06:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I received a report that someone\Nentered the city illegally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Have they come by here, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If they have, and you've seen them, be\Nsure to tell me if us all are teeter!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mambo, mambo, shiki shiki\Nmoonfish, why we gotta do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's party with the ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we\Nhaven't seen anyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They sound like common thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they really that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.28,0:06:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely they don't demand the\Nattention of princes such as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.32,0:06:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We have yet to ascertain their identities,\Nso it may be too early to say just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know! Let's hear it!\NNobody! Knock him up! Nobody!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all this commotion? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.02,0:06:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, it's the princess\Nfrom Neptune's army!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain in the ass. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.80,0:07:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall search elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for interrupting your leisure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll dance again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And away we go. Latina. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the border guards\Nwere just seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.48,0:07:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.56,0:07:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That was too much blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs help now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.86,0:07:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's done poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.77,0:07:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All that pent-up lust\Nlet loose in one shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the pirate's Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.78,0:07:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ammo Knights, go! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.68,0:07:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, the gods\Nare gonna catch him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Our orders are clear, but we don't want\Nto start crap with the Neptune army.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on a second, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want to fight. We\Ncan sort out our crimes later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But right now there's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.70,0:08:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our friend has lost a lot of\Nblood and we need a donor, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If you leave him here or throw him in\Njail, he'll be dead within an hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,His blood type is SRH negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's rare, but does\Nsomeone here have it? Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishmen and humans do have the\Nsame kind of blood, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, Jim We don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.58,0:08:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, this is serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanchi, we are not losing you over this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.62,0:08:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let my friend die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper Chin, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishmen and humans do have the same kind\Nof blood, but the situation is complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hamo, hamo, hamo, hamo, hamo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a load of these humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are stupid, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:09:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you a big enough\Njerk the last time we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Hammond, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's from the Fishmen District.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hammo, Hammo, Hammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting a damn drop\Nfrom anybody on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would we share our blood with\Ndisgusting creatures like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans aren't worth a thing down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if someone did help you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.94,0:09:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,decent fishmen like us who hate humans\Nwould make sure they were punished for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He can bleed out right\Nhere for all I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Many fishmen would happily watch him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a law for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You know when we followed for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,fishmen are forbidden to\Nshare blood with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Law sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it was humans who\Nset the rule in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Our blood may be the same, but for\Nages you've treated us like monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Or worse, like? animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.10,0:09:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your blood was too good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.22,0:09:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, that's why\NFisher Tiger, the hero of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,this island, died.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:10:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He fought to free slaves of all races,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and when that battle took\Nits toll on his body,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,when he lied bloody and battered, not\Na single human would offer their blood
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,to return his kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A transfusion would have saved\Nhim, but because of humans, he
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.06,0:10:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.97,0:10:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not much of a choice, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend is going to\Ndie, and you're coming
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to the Fishman District with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart Jones, the captain of\Nthe new Fishman Pirates, is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.34,0:10:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,expecting you, and he doesn't\Nlike to wait. That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.22,0:10:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who cares about some\Nstupid rule in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to listen to this, thug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's someone's life
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,on the line here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do anything it takes to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time to get stuck On pride
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jamie come along Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.60,0:10:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you by force if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Charles
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.74,0:10:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not joining your stupid group.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My word, he made quick work of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It just gave up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.86,0:11:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Luffy can tame sea monsters now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.16,0:11:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That was crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy-chan, up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Sanji-chan up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go back to town!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's lots of humans there, so we\Nmight be able to find a blood donor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry. I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:11:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool. Ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.96,0:12:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kuma. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to head over\Nto town. Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.06,0:12:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd do anything in the\Nworld to save his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.84,0:12:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't have the right blood type.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.26,0:12:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.17,0:12:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,it's nothing for you to\Nfeel bad about if he wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,such a perv this would have\Nhappened in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.82,0:12:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dying, and he's\Nstill thinking about boobs
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.24,0:12:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We may be friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but considering the way you and\NHachi got treated back on Sabo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Odi I should have guessed\Nsomething like this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some deep-rooted\Nstuff going on here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and to be honest, I\Ndon't know how this will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no promise anyone\Nwill help us back in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on human donors for blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but I haven't seen any\Nat all this past month.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, your ship is the first\None we've had in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:12:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought everyone had\Nto come through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it wasn't like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:12:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody can say for certain,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but we think someone's attacking the\Ntravelers, like what happened with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something going\Non in this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have a sinking feeling\Nit's about to get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, ladies, you must be forthright.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.72,0:13:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you try to conceal\Nthose pirates from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry, Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.20,0:13:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.56,0:13:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like what\Nhappened wasn't their fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're Kami's friends, and they\Ngot split up from their crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.62,0:13:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so we didn't want them to be thrown\Nin jail as soon as they got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.24,0:13:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they find a donor for Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, you misunderstood us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.64,0:13:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Their method of entry is no concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're quite famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It would only be a small formality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't consider them enemies, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.87,0:13:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We had different business with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Re mi fa sol a ti!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this is all our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We had a message to pass\Non to them, from Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.34,0:14:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you awake? Talk to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.36,0:14:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You pulled through!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're safe in a town right\Nby the harbor. I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You almost lost all\Nthe blood in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.56,0:14:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was starting to think\Nwe'd never find you a donor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a real close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.96,0:14:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That so? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell happened\Nto me? You shouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,be sitting up so quickly\Nyou need to rest i
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,just don't get it i\Nmean the fish could have
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,given blood but no instead\Nwe had to run all over
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.02,0:14:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,town looking for another\Nhuman which took forever
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,i know right i was\Nstarting to lose hope there
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm sorry i appreciate\Nwhat you did though but
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,i just don't remember\Nmuch why'd this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.52,0:15:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was I, and what was I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.90,0:15:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,When I think about it,\Nit's all a big blub.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you try to force the memories,\Nyou could relapse. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.30,0:15:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't met your donors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So here, say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And also, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, could my savior\Nhave been a dainty girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're only human.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.12,0:15:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, if we don't look\Nout for each other, who will?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want, we can give you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's back to his old self.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.90,0:16:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not exactly gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.52,0:16:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, can I see the cut on\Nyour arm for a second please?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, that wound's\Npoisonous. Oh, wow. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have been the\Nsting I felt earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the fishmen got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't seem poisoned. You feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.82,0:16:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, we should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.22,0:16:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This stuff's probably deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.28,0:16:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you're all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.57,0:16:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.49,0:16:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.40,0:16:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must have somehow developed an\Nantibody to fight against this kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, have you ever experienced\Na poisoning like this in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, back when I was at Impel\NDown, I almost got killed that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not funny at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.32,0:17:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.12,0:17:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it was that octopus swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, he blocked my punch, so\Nhe's got to be strong. No prob.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.06,0:17:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time I'll be ready
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,they're
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.42,0:17:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,loud I think that came from by that cove
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.18,0:17:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,don't care I've got bigger problems these\Nguys are messed up real bad and what's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.29,0:17:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat got poisoned too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dead if he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm positive I heard their screams come
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishii!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.61,0:17:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where I saw them last.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.12,0:17:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But where in the world could they
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.86,0:17:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.77,0:17:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Did anyone else hear them say\Nsomething about opening up a barrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:17:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the owner of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.34,0:18:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She okayed Sanji resting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.76,0:18:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Be Madam Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.72,0:18:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool, thanks and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Has the blonde boy's\Ncondition improved at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, but it's best he doesn't\Nmeet you because you're so
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.22,0:18:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,beautiful, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.52,0:18:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, we probably shouldn't\Ntell him he's in the back
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.06,0:18:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,of the mermaid cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.08,0:18:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if we want him to get well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.14,0:18:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why keep it a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Because doctor's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Chakra's pretty sure that if Sanji\Nfinds out he's gonna have a bad relapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.48,0:18:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,strange prognosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.60,0:18:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, big lady! Fish lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.76,0:18:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was rude. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.58,0:18:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's also not on the list of\Nthings you're allowed to touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.64,0:18:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.72,0:18:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking at Madam\NCharlie's crystal ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.34,0:18:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,With it, she can see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.24,0:18:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Her precognitive visions are\Nwhy she's famous. Well it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:19:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,used to be not anymore the\Nfuture isn't ours to know right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.40,0:19:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds rough oh by the way\Nhow do mermaids take a dump?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,we are not talking\Nabout mermaid poop again
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry why don't you take\Nthe rest of the day off?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma i think your friends would appreciate\Na tour Of the island really you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,it's fine you deserve it\Nseeing as you're always
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,working so Hard besides business\Nhas been slow with human
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.42,0:19:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,guests so uncommon these days\Nso we have to be Extra good
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,hosts the girls from the\Ncove should show up soon then
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll have more hands around\NHere than a starfish more
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.84,0:19:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,than starfish oh that's right\Ncrap i should have already
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Delivered Papa Goose clams\Nby now. Wow I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,what's going on i bet he's\Ngetting mad waiting for his food
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite he's enjoying the cafe an old\Nfriend of his suddenly came into town and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.98,0:19:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,they've been Living it up since he arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:20:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,wait he's here i
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't want to bring
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.23,0:20:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,this up in front of her But madam told me\Na lot of stories from when she was little
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She said in those days, human pirates came\Nto the island all the time, but that was
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.18,0:20:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,quite a while ago about a year before\Nthe great Pirate era began it's hard for
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,her to talk about things sometimes especially\Nwhen she foresees bad Stuff like the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,war at marineford and whitebeard's death\Nwhat can you imagine knowing something
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.06,0:20:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Horrible will happen that you can't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that must be terrifying\Nhey where's chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.08,0:20:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,oh he said he Who's going to hang\Nout here and look after Sunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, we're on what's\Nconsidered Coral Hill's main street.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.98,0:20:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is the primary\Nentrance to the Mermaid Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.20,0:20:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I thought I was\Ngoing to starve to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They might only serve snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.66,0:21:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got cakes and sea\Nfruit, too. And meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.36,0:21:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.32,0:21:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We merfolk don't really eat meat and fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.96,0:21:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have wakame Barrel,\Nmosugu tarts, kelp souffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You call that food?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.52,0:21:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, we do have some meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,From shellfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Scallop sandwiches, plant pizza, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.34,0:21:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me the bad name!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.14,0:21:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, okay, be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's all go find papagoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.22,0:21:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shellfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.13,0:21:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of crab is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.30,0:21:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.14,0:21:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, it's Brooke! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.58,0:21:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.49,0:21:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy and Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.41,0:21:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And Kuma, you've become\Nsuch a lovely young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You had no idea how much I've missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me you were coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry it's been so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes you Papagu's\Nold friend we heard about!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.76,0:21:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come see us again, k?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a great time, Soul King.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.12,0:22:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back, lovely ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.12,0:22:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of bones to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.10,0:22:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gone limp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.24,0:22:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.62,0:22:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Skeletons are always rigid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.84,0:22:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing I'm already dead, or I would\Nprobably die of embarrassment right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.78,0:22:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This cafe's really put Brook in rare form.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.84,0:22:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever's going on inside\Nmust be held up there, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.80,0:22:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.71,0:22:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you in such a hurry for?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.70,0:22:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're interested in the cafe,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and I get that, but it's not\Nlike it's going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.34,0:22:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's come back when you\Nhave your whole crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.58,0:22:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bone Daddy and I were just\Nabout to head back to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.06,0:22:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, you can eat all\Nthe Sea King meat you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.68,0:22:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.06,0:22:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a wild animal. You feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.34,0:22:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I eat boring shellfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:22:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I need food with a little more bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.24,0:23:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, I brought\Nyour order of clams. Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.74,0:23:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My favorite treat is finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so much for your diet!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.22,0:23:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, merfolk are the only\Nones who don't eat meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.80,0:23:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishmen eat the stuff all the time, so\Nit's not like you can't get it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.04,0:23:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just not as common.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.68,0:23:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Vander Decken thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.40,0:23:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But why is there a wanted\Nposter for a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.22,0:23:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, wasn't this guy on\Nthe haunted ship we saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.62,0:23:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw him? For real?\NUh-huh. No way. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.92,0:23:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Our nation's been looking\Nfor him for years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.60,0:23:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The dude's a pirate and\Na Newgate undersea thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you all about it on the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.40,0:23:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's load up. And go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.36,0:23:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Story goes, Vandertekin was hard up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.68,0:23:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy was totally head over heels for\Nthe mermaid princess of the Ryugu kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.68,0:23:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He was so desperate, he\Nsent love letters daily.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.54,0:23:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How stalkery, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.46,0:24:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Gave up letters, started sending gifts\Ninstead, then threats, so to marry her!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.30,0:24:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fucking puppy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.21,0:24:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels great!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.13,0:24:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bringing him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me? Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.32,0:24:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.32,0:24:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The mermaid princess got\Nscared, and so of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.40,0:24:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The stalker became a national concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.92,0:24:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but that was just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.48,0:24:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Her father, King Neptune, got mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.88,0:24:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Which led to him sending the three princes
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.54,0:24:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you saw earlier off to hunt Vander Decken.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.86,0:24:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But even with the army,\Nthey can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.94,0:24:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.50,0:24:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole all my thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.54,0:24:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, King Neptune's\Nthe god of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.94,0:24:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, he's in control of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.96,0:24:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's not enough responsibility,\Nhe has four children to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.00,0:24:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The mermaid princess is the youngest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.08,0:24:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So obviously the three princes are\Nthe older kids in the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.56,0:24:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.84,0:24:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, but something\Nstill doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.18,0:24:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Vander Decken must be quite ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.22,0:24:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If he isn't a ghost, I imagine\Nhe's a few hundred years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.50,0:24:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,At least.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.80,0:24:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.78,0:25:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. That doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.92,0:25:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, unless you ignore the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.86,0:25:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, there's no denying that he existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.32,0:25:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But the truth of the matter is\Nthat the legendary sea captain
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.92,0:25:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Vander Decken died sometime after\Nhe arrived here on Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.84,0:25:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and hasn't been heard from since.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.42,0:25:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, the ship you say you saw\Nprobably was the Flying Dutchman, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.88,0:25:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's his descendant who's on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.92,0:25:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.83,0:25:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Vander Decken the Ninth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.72,0:25:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.64,0:25:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I have to say, it's a relief to\Nfind out he's not a ghost after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.62,0:25:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Believing we had come into\Ncontact with someone from
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.62,0:25:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the afterlife was making me\Ncontemplate my own mortality.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.72,0:25:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And considering I'm a skeleton,\NI don't have much of that left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.64,0:25:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to tell an exciting story.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.50,0:25:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I thought merfolk and\Nfishmen all look the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but the more I see, the less they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.26,0:25:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out those old ones down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.00,0:25:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Their fins are split like Granny Kokoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.30,0:26:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,See those babies? Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.28,0:26:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll notice the father is a fishman, but\Nthe children are a mix of both species.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.78,0:26:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because when a\Nmermaid and a fishman
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.82,0:26:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,love each other very much\Nand decide to get busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.36,0:26:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Their kids can come out\Nlooking like either parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.46,0:26:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.37,0:26:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Four possibilities for the happy family.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.84,0:26:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's why they all look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.42,0:26:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.20,0:26:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we finally\Nmade it to the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.30,0:26:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.24,0:26:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.48,0:26:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.00,0:26:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.02,0:26:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a candy factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.32,0:26:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.23,0:26:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why is there a pirate flag on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.02,0:26:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.93,0:26:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That flag's everywhere here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.14,0:26:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,By the entrance and the\Nharbor, it's a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.00,0:26:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And for good reason at that, it\Nsymbolizes that we're protected. You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.88,0:26:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the flag belongs to a famous pirate\Nnamed Charlotte Lin-Lin of the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.20,0:26:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's better known as Big\NMom, one of the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.00,0:26:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.42,0:27:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Back before the war in Marineford,\NWhitebeard was this island's guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.18,0:27:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that he's dead, someone\Nelse had to take his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.78,0:27:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And that someone happened to be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.50,0:27:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.84,0:27:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, she demands a whole ton\Nof candy in exchange for her services.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.76,0:27:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hence the factory that you just saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.12,0:27:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.40,0:27:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This country wouldn't be\Nable to survive without
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.56,0:27:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the protection of\Npowerful people like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, this is a dangerous\Nplace where pirates come and go,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.58,0:27:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and more often than not,\Nthey aren't very friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.28,0:27:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.26,0:27:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, she's filling in\Nwhere Whitebeard left off,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.66,0:27:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so that's gotta mean she's\Na good person, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.18,0:27:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Depends on how you look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.84,0:27:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard never asked for anything\Nin return for his protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.94,0:27:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom, on the other hand, treats it\Nlike a business rather than a charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.42,0:27:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, that's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,An emperor. Like shakes. Crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.14,0:27:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope they get to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.82,0:27:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Eyes forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.12,0:27:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where all the\Ncelebrity types live.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.76,0:27:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishburly Hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.34,0:27:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That tall building right in front is\NPapa Goose's house, where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.66,0:27:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.78,0:28:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,For one starfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.24,0:28:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.94,0:28:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.34,0:28:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let this happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.44,0:28:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Madame Shirley, from the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.28,0:28:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.46,0:28:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.14,0:28:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.05,0:28:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.98,0:28:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.54,0:28:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.64,0:28:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.55,0:28:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.72,0:28:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.00,0:28:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate boy in a Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.12,0:28:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.06,0:28:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He must leave the country! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.66,0:28:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.62,0:28:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're having a premonition?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.96,0:28:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I swore I wouldn't use this power, but\Nsomething about that boy felt off to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.94,0:28:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.85,0:28:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to\Nlook into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.94,0:28:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.62,0:28:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us, what did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.34,0:28:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.56,0:28:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Charlie, tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.88,0:28:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.18,0:29:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I'm wrong, and\Nthat it won't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.46,0:29:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him clearly,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.62,0:29:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,surrounded by flames,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.20,0:29:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,because Straw Hat Luffy, Fishman Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.18,0:29:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,our country will be destroyed.
